silm:instances_papers_01_orientation_chapters_02_typed_source_signature_sections_02_operations_as_typed_arrows_concrete_anchor_11 silm:hasExample "In '02OperationsAsTypedArrowsConcreteAnchor11', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, the bare taxonomic epithet catus (Felis catus TSN 183798); a taxonomy-source leg, not Mittens." .
